  The Echo 2nd gen's parametric EQ (TECHO5's lib/asp/peq.go) uses the
  vendor's own filter designs as EchoMuse PR #687 read them out of the
  vendor's library: Zölzer's shelf and peak, the shelf taking no Q and
  root two written as 1.4142. Written there from those findings, not
  copied.

The vendor's own audio tuning is not here and is not shipped: it is read off
the device at run time from the vendor partition, the way TECHO5 does it. The
coefficients are the vendor's and are not ours to ship.
